{"id":"666737","name":"菠萝鸡翅","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"","cover":"images/666737/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡翅","amount":"6个（个大）"}],"sub":[{"name":"菠萝","amount":"一块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡翅洗净，两面切两刀，菠萝切片备用​。","img":"images/666737/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"​鸡翅放入盆中，加入生抽1勺、老抽半勺、淀粉1勺、少许盐、白胡椒粉抓匀，腌30分钟​。","img":"images/666737/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中油热煎鸡翅，两面金黄捞出​。","img":"images/666737/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"​煎菠萝片，煎出香味。","img":"images/666737/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡翅放入。","img":"images/666737/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入料汁（生抽1勺，蚝油1勺，蜂蜜1勺，小半碗水），煮12分钟大火收汁。","img":"images/666737/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"关火。","img":"images/666737/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/666737/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/666737/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}